      "writtenOn": "2024-08-06T07:07:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve thought about this problem before.\nMy conclusion was that \"what URL scheme and format are supported\" is a question decided by the VM payload. In our case, this is something decided by the VM image (the CrOS OpenUrl API).\nThere is noway we can implement a one-size-fits-all check here in the VmLauncherApp that works well with all possible VM payload.\nThus I think the URL scheme should be checked in the user frontend (FerrochromeApp) or backend (VM guest system), not in the guest-agnostic VirtualMachine framework.",
      "parentUuid": "f8203f5b_e4d3bac1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 750,
        "startChar": 17,
